{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>巴基斯坦一間學校屋頂倒塌，最少35人死亡，另外逾50人受傷。</p><p></p><p>事發的學校位於西北部城市白沙瓦，救援人員到場，在瓦礫中搜救失蹤者。有救援人員表示，是其中一層的天花倒塌，壓垮一樓課室的天花，導致裡面的師生被困。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PAK.COLLAPSE-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OCLqC85tHO1792074812.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>醫院指死者包括一名教師，其餘都是學生，部分傷者情況危殆。當局正調查倒塌原因，白沙瓦警方指學校負責人已經被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T15:20:53.935031+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:57:57.640423+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:18:39.007955+00:00","content_hash":"7a7957d6741b03f8f53aac1067c3bb3e030a5bd3596e124e0a86237b7e7de055","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}